      "name": "Global Wind Atlas WRF mesoscale simulation",
      "upstreamSource": [
        "https://catalog.opengrid.org/ds/ecmwf-era5"
      ],
      "pointerRationale": "The intermediate mesoscale model run behind the Global Wind Atlas. Not itself a published dataset, so it is recorded as an upstream node rather than catalogued: PRD \u00a74.1 D4 is explicit that an absent upstream link means 'not captured', so an intermediate that exists must be recorded even when it cannot be catalogued."
    },
